 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You're on trial for treason. Your only defense? Admitting you're a forger.",
   "key": [
    "FORGER."
   ],
   "speaker": "capy",
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "han": {
     "mood": "worried",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "capy"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": "left",
    "han": "center",
    "expert": false,
    "officer": false,
    "judge": false
   },
   "board": [
    "TREASON",
    "OR FRAUD?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You're Han van Meegeren. A Dutch painter. Critics call your work unoriginal. Ouch.",
   "key": [
    "UNORIGINAL."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "wide",
    "on": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "han": {
     "mood": "sad",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": false
   },
   "board": [
    "HAN VAN",
    "MEEGEREN"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "So you plan your revenge. You paint fake Vermeers.",
   "key": [
    "VERMEERS."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "han": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "You bake the paint hard. You fake the cracks of old age.",
   "key": [
    "CRACKS"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "han": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "point",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "A top expert sees one. He calls it a masterpiece.",
   "key": [
    "MASTERPIECE."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "expert",
    "with": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "expert": {
     "mood": "happy",
     "action": "cheer"
    },
    "han": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "expert"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "expert": "left",
    "han": "right"
   },
   "board": [
    "SUPPER AT",
    "EMMAUS"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "A museum buys it. For a fortune. You keep going. More fake Vermeers. More fortunes.",
   "key": [
    "GOING."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "expert"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "shocked",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "expert"
    },
    "expert": {
     "mood": "happy",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": "left",
    "expert": "right",
    "han": false
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the war comes. One buyer is Hermann Goering. A top Nazi.",
   "key": [
    "GOERING."
   ],
   "set": "office",
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "han": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "talk",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "han": "center"
   },
   "board": [
    "BUYER:",
    "GOERING"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You sell him a fake Vermeer. He pays with stolen paintings.",
   "key": [
    "STOLEN"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "han": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Over a hundred of them. For one fake.",
   "key": [
    "HUNDRED"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "capy"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "shocked",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": "center",
    "han": false
   },
   "board": [
    "137",
    "PAINTINGS"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The war ends. Allied officers find the Vermeer.",
   "key": [
    "VERMEER."
   ],
   "set": "vault",
   "shot": {
    "type": "wide",
    "on": "officer"
   },
   "act": {
    "officer": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "hold",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "officer": "center"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "They trace the sale back to you.",
   "key": [
    "YOU."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "officer"
   },
   "act": {
    "officer": {
     "mood": "angry",
     "action": "point",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "capy": {
     "mood": "worried",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "officer"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": "left",
    "officer": "right"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "You sold a national treasure to the Nazis. That's treason. The penalty can be death.",
   "key": [
    "TREASON."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "officer"
   },
   "act": {
    "officer": {
     "mood": "angry",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": false
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "So you confess. It's not a Vermeer. You painted it.",
   "key": [
    "PAINTED"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "han": {
     "mood": "worried",
     "action": "shrug",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody believes you. You're too good.",
   "key": [
    "NOBODY"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "han"
    },
    "han": {
     "mood": "sad",
     "action": "slump"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": "left",
    "han": "right",
    "officer": false
   },
   "sfx": [
    [
     0.2,
     "hit"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "So you paint a new fake Vermeer. In front of witnesses.",
   "key": [
    "WITNESSES."
   ],
   "set": "study",
   "shot": {
    "type": "low",
    "on": "han"
   },
   "act": {
    "han": {
     "mood": "happy",
     "action": "point",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "han": "center"
   },
   "board": [
    "LIVE",
    "DEMO"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Now they believe you. Traitor? No. Just a con man.",
   "key": [
    "CON"
   ],
   "set": "press",
   "shot": {
    "type": "wide",
    "on": "judge"
   },
   "act": {
    "judge": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "judge": "center"
   },
   "board": [
    "VERDICT:",
    "FORGERY"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Your sentence? One year in prison.",
   "cap": "Your sentence? 1 year in prison.",
   "key": [
    "YEAR"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "judge"
   },
   "act": {
    "judge": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "point",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "The public loves you. You fooled Goering.",
   "key": [
    "FOOLED"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "judge"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "happy",
     "action": "clap",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "judge": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "capy"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": "left",
    "judge": "right"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Your best painting? The one that proved you were a fake.",
   "key": [
    "FAKE."
   ],
   "set": "study",
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "capy"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "place": {
    "capy": "center"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Traitor or forger? Which would you rather be called?",
   "key": [
